Package: gh0st
Version: @GH0ST_VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Gh0st OS <15324879+therezor@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: gh0st-panel-modules, xdg-user-dirs, network-manager, wireplumber,
 bluez, rfkill, pkexec, polkitd, libpam-modules-bin, raspi-utils-core, passwd, apt,
 iw, dnsmasq-base, nftables, curl, sqv
Description: the Gh0st OS shell and Settings
 The home screen, switcher and OS bars (gh0st shell), Settings
 (gh0st-settings), Updates (gh0st-update and the update engine), the
 Store (gh0st-store and its engine), the keyring and session services
 (gh0st keyring, gh0st session) with the Keyring app (gh0st-keyring), and
 the root helper. Static binaries;
 the Depends are the commands they run: nmcli, wpctl, bluetoothctl, rfkill,
 pkexec, vcgencmd, unix_chkpwd, passwd, iw, and systemd's systemctl,
 timedatectl and hostnamectl. dnsmasq-base and nftables are what
 NetworkManager's shared mode runs for the hotspot: DHCP and DNS, and NAT.
 The Store's engine fetches with curl and checks the app list with sqv.
